  [/^Automatic triage of new issues/, 'Triage means Winston reads each new issue, rates its risk and plans it; this workflow does that the moment an issue is opened.'],
  [/^Automatic triage is up to date/, 'The newer version makes one model call and Winston\'s code applies the result, so nothing it needs can be refused without notice; an old pinned version runs an older script.'],
  [/^Two workflows triage/, 'Two workflows that triage the same issue give it two verdicts, and one may start work the other stopped on.'],
  [/^Automatic triage keys/, 'The workflow signs in to GitHub and Claude with these two keys; without them new issues wait untriaged.'],
