  [/^old chattr install\.sh hooks/, 'These old entries run chattr\'s hooks from an old copy, and Winston\'s stay off while they exist.'],
  [/^chattr plugin left enabled/, 'An enabled entry for a plugin whose files are gone would switch Winston\'s chattr hooks off again if the files came back.'],
  [/^chattr plugin installed in repositories/, 'In a session in those repositories, Winston\'s chattr hooks stay off and the old plugin\'s run instead.'],
  [/^chattr plugin installed but off/, 'Turning the old plugin back on would switch Winston\'s chattr hooks off.'],
  [/^stray chattr command/, 'A second chattr command on PATH runs an old copy that drifts from Winston\'s.'],
